					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Vendor does not complete [PercentageOfOrderCancellations]% of orders ([NumberOfOrderCancellations] from [OrdersCount])</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>فروشنده [PercentageOfOrderCancellations] درصد سفارش‌ها را تکمیل نمی‌کند ([NumberOfOrderCancellations] از [OrdersCount])</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Il fornitore non effettua [PercentageOfOrderCancellations]% degli ordini ([NumberOfOrderCancellations] su [OrdersCount])</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Dostawca nie w pełni wypełnia[PercentageOfOrderCancellations]% zamówień ([NumberOfOrderCancellations]z[OrdersCount])</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Поставщик не полностью выполняет [PercentageOfOrderCancellations]% заказов ([NumberOfOrderCancellations] из [OrdersCount])</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Tedarikçi siparişlerin % [PercentageOfOrderCancellations] ([OrdersCount]'te [NumberOfOrderCancellations]) kadarını yerine getirmez</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Nhà cung cấp không thực hiện toàn phần [PercentageOfOrderCancellations]% đơn hàng ([NumberOfOrderCancellations] trong số [OrdersCount])</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
