						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>In partially completed orders [PercentageOfCancellations]% of the items are canceled ([NumberOfCancellations] out of [Count]), out of which:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>در سفارش‌های نیمه‌تکمیل، [PercentageOfCancellations] درصد اقلام لغو شده‌اند ([NumberOfCancellations] از [Count])، که از این میان:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Negli ordini non effettuati completamente vengono annullate [PercentageOfCancellations]% delle posizioni ([NumberOfCancellations] su [Count]), tra cui:</v8:content>
